        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_661c9ac1c752494fb124c4eb937d99da",
      "statement": "Each video frame has its clip-local frame number burned in, and the model is told to read frame numbers from that counter rather than from video time, so answers land in clip frames regardless of sampling.",
